Design notes on the additions
-----------------------------
The geometry pipeline is an independent implementation written against the
SVG 1.1 specification (appendix F.6.5 for arc conversion, de Casteljau for
subdivision). It does not vendor or copy code from flubber, GSAP, anime.js or
any other morphing library. The easing functions are the standard Robert
Penner style formulations; the cubic-bezier solver is the usual Newton
iteration over the Bernstein basis.

Third-party runtime dependencies: none. Build and test tooling only:
esbuild (MIT), karma/jasmine (MIT, inherited from upstream), uglify-js (BSD-2).
